SET keyword

  SET DEFAULT folder        changes the current folder: SET DEFAULT [.LOGS],
                            SET DEFAULT [-] goes up, SET DEFAULT SYS$LOGIN:
                            goes home
  SET PASSWORD              changes your password. It asks for the old one,
                            the new one, and the new one again.
  SET TERMINAL /SCHEME=c    changes the screen colors: GREEN, AMBER, BLUE
                            or WHITE
  SET HALT                  stops the system. Needs OPER.
  SET HALT RESTART          restarts the system. Needs OPER.
  /MAINTENANCE              asks for the maintenance image. This build
                            cannot pass that request on and says so.
